 Rogan Lynch <roganl@gmail.com> 1764955914 -0800\n\nAdd PingNode RPC protobuf definitions\n\nAdd PingNode RPC endpoint to the gRPC API:\n- Added PingNodeRequest and PingNodeResponse messages to node.proto\n- Added PingNode RPC to HeadscaleService in headscale.proto\n- Generated Go code from proto definitions\n\nThis is part of the PingRequest feature split into separate PRs.\nPR #4a focuses on protobuf definitions and code generation.\n","verified_at":"2025-12-06T00:52:42Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"9d7d05f252ad7266367a0111042ffec8d0e6a76b","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDlkN2QwNWYyNTJhZDcyNjYzNjdhMDExMTA0MmZmZWM4ZDBlNmE3NmI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/9d7d05f252ad7266367a0111042ffec8d0e6a76b","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/9d7d05f252ad7266367a0111042ffec8d0e6a76b","author":{"name":"Rogan Lynch","email":"roganl@gmail.com","date":"2025-12-05T17:37:14Z"},"committer":{"name":"Rogan Lynch","email":"roganl@gmail.com","date":"2025-12-05T17:37:14Z"},"tree":{"sha":"beaf79bae7d3411055a71b8e6914745f263964db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/beaf79bae7d3411055a71b8e6914745f263964db"},"message":"Implement PingNode gRPC handler\n\nAdd gRPC server implementation for PingNode RPC endpoint:\n- Validates node exists and target IP is valid\n- Uses node's primary IP if no target specified\n- Calls CheckNodeOnline from PingManager (PR #2b)\n- Converts tailcfg.PingResponse to protobuf response\n- Returns detailed ping information including type, latency, endpoint, DERP region\n\nThis implementation connects the protobuf API (PR #4a) with the core\nPingManager functionality (PR #2b).\n\nPart of the PingRequest feature split into separate PRs.\nPR #4b focuses on gRPC server implementation.","parents":[{"sha":"85bab21ba23bee9e4c954cd18f4c2d8c9d51e37e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/85bab21ba23bee9e4c954cd18f4c2d8c9d51e37e","html_url":"https://github.com/juanf